  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact 2 - Child Protection ASRHR_NPL - Transforming the future - for and with children 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming the future - for and with children 2024-2028. Impact area 2: Children are protected against violence and harmful practices and their sexual and reproductive health rights are realised. The projects include initiatives to address gender-based violence and promote girls education, in addition to collaborations with local organizations focused on women&#x2019;s and girls empowerments. It includes explicit gender equality objectives and indicators. It also includes initiatives to support the inclusion of children with disabilities in education, and collaborations with organizations focused on disability rights to promote the inclusion of persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
